ng recurrence: a3 = a2 + a1 =4+2=6 correct. Good.\n\nThus a_n follows Fibonacci with a1=2, a2=4. So a_n = 2*F_{n+1}? Let's compute Fibonacci F1=1, F2=1, F3=2, F4=3, F5=5, F6=8, etc. Let's compute a_n: n=1 ->2, n=2->4, n=3->6, n=4->10, n=5->16, n=6->26, n=7->42, n=8->68, n=9->110, n=10->178, n=11->288, n=12->466, n=13->754? Let's compute via recurrence: a4 = a3 + a2 =6+4=10. a5=10+6=16. a6=16+10"}}],"created":1790936782,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":3713,"total_tokens":4481,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-HEGRQ34iqlpUCSN5ZEQEEpk9MpZJTqYH","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":3713,"prompt_ms":488.911,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.13167546458389442,"prompt_per_second":7594.429251949741,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2463.209,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.2114850065189047,"predicted_per_second":311.38242836884734}}